{"book":"kinney","chapter":"aws","chapterTitle":"نشر تطبيقات الويب على AWS","slug":"cloudfront-distribution-solution","title":"الحل","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"لماذا-يعمل-هذا","text":"لماذا يعمل هذا"},{"depth":2,"id":"إنشاء-origin-access-control","text":"إنشاء Origin Access Control"},{"depth":2,"id":"إنشاء-التوزيع","text":"إنشاء التوزيع"},{"depth":2,"id":"تحديث-سياسة-حاوية-s3","text":"تحديث سياسة حاوية S3"},{"depth":2,"id":"إعادة-تمكين-حظر-الوصول-العام","text":"إعادة تمكين حظر الوصول العام"},{"depth":2,"id":"اختبار-توجيه-spa","text":"اختبار توجيه SPA"},{"depth":2,"id":"إرفاق-سياسة-ترويسات-الأمان","text":"إرفاق سياسة ترويسات الأمان"},{"depth":2,"id":"التحقق-النهائي","text":"التحقق النهائي"},{"depth":2,"id":"ملخص-الموارد-المنشأة","text":"ملخص الموارد المنشأة"},{"depth":2,"id":"التنظيف","text":"التنظيف"}],"html":"<p>هذا هو الحل الكامل لـ<a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/courses/aws/cloudfront-distribution-exercise\">تمرين توزيع CloudFront</a>. وكل أمر معروض مع ناتجه المتوقع.</p>\n<h2 id=\"لماذا-يعمل-هذا\">لماذا يعمل هذا</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>تُبقي Origin Access Control حاوية S3 خاصة مع السماح لـ CloudFront بقراءة الملفات التي يحتاجها مستخدموك.</li>\n<li>تجعل استجابات الأخطاء المخصّصة تطبيق الصفحة الواحدة يتصرف كموجّه واجهة أمامية بدلًا من كومة أخطاء كائنات مفقودة.</li>\n<li>يصبح التوزيع نقطة فرض HTTPS والتخزين المؤقت وترويسات الأمان، ولهذا يجلس بين مستخدميك والحاوية.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>نصيحة</strong></p>\n<p>إن تغيّر ناتج وحدة التحكم أو CLI أثناء عملك، فأبقِ <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/Introduction.html\">دليل مطوّري CloudFront</a> و<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/private-content-restricting-access-to-s3.html\">دليل إعداد OAC</a> مفتوحين.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"إنشاء-origin-access-control\">إنشاء Origin Access Control</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront create-origin-access-control \\\n  --origin-access-control-config <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;{\n    &quot;Name&quot;: &quot;my-frontend-app-oac&quot;,\n    &quot;Description&quot;: &quot;OAC for my-frontend-app-assets S3 bucket&quot;,\n    &quot;SigningProtocol&quot;: &quot;sigv4&quot;,\n    &quot;SigningBehavior&quot;: &quot;always&quot;,\n    &quot;OriginAccessControlOriginType&quot;: &quot;s3&quot;\n  }&#x27;</span> \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json\n</code></pre>\n<p>الناتج المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Location&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;https://cloudfront.amazonaws.com/2020-05-31/origin-access-control/E1OAC2EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ETag&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;E1ETAG1EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessControl&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Id&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;E1OAC2EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessControlConfig&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Name&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;my-frontend-app-oac&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Description&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;OAC for my-frontend-app-assets S3 bucket&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;SigningProtocol&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;sigv4&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;SigningBehavior&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;always&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessControlOriginType&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;s3&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>احفظ قيمة <code>Id</code> (<code>E1OAC2EXAMPLE</code>).</p>\n<h2 id=\"إنشاء-التوزيع\">إنشاء التوزيع</h2>\n<p>احفظ ما يلي باسم <code>distribution-config.json</code> (وهو متاح أيضًا في <a href=\"https://github.com/stevekinney/scratch-lab/blob/main/cloudfront/distribution-config.json\">مستودع Scratch Lab</a>):</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CallerReference&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;my-frontend-app-2026-03-18&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Comment&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;CloudFront distribution for my-frontend-app-assets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Enabled&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DefaultRootObject&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;index.html&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;PriceClass&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;PriceClass_100&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;HttpVersion&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;http2and3&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;IsIPV6Enabled&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Origins&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Id&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;S3-my-frontend-app-assets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DomainName&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;my-frontend-app-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessControlId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;E1OAC2EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;S3OriginConfig&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessIdentity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DefaultCacheBehavior&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;TargetOriginId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;S3-my-frontend-app-assets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ViewerProtocolPolicy&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;redirect-to-https&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CachePolicyId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;658327ea-f89d-4fab-a63d-7e88639e58f6&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Compress&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;AllowedMethods&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;GET&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;HEAD&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CachedMethods&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;GET&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;HEAD&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CustomErrorResponses&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">403</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponsePagePath&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/index.html&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponseCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;200&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCachingMinTTL&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">404</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponsePagePath&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/index.html&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponseCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;200&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCachingMinTTL&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ViewerCertificate&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CloudFrontDefaultCertificate&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Restrictions&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;GeoRestriction&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;RestrictionType&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;none&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>أنشئ التوزيع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront create-distribution \\\n  --distribution-config file://distribution-config.json \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json\n</code></pre>\n<p>الناتج المتوقع (مختصرًا إلى الحقول التي تحتاجها):</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Distribution&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Id&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;E1A2B3C4D5E6F7&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ARN&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;arn:aws:cloudfront::123456789012:distribution/E1A2B3C4D5E6F7&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DomainName&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Status&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;InProgress&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DistributionConfig&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CallerReference&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;my-frontend-app-2026-03-18&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Comment&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;CloudFront distribution for my-frontend-app-assets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Enabled&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DefaultRootObject&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;index.html&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;PriceClass&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;PriceClass_100&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;HttpVersion&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;http2and3&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;IsIPV6Enabled&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Origins&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Id&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;S3-my-frontend-app-assets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DomainName&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;my-frontend-app-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessControlId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;E1OAC2EXAMPLE&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;S3OriginConfig&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n              <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;OriginAccessIdentity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DefaultCacheBehavior&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;TargetOriginId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;S3-my-frontend-app-assets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ViewerProtocolPolicy&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;redirect-to-https&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CachePolicyId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;658327ea-f89d-4fab-a63d-7e88639e58f6&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Compress&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;AllowedMethods&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;GET&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;HEAD&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CachedMethods&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;GET&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;HEAD&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CustomErrorResponses&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">403</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponsePagePath&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/index.html&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponseCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;200&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCachingMinTTL&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">404</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponsePagePath&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/index.html&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponseCode&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;200&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ErrorCachingMinTTL&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ViewerCertificate&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CloudFrontDefaultCertificate&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Restrictions&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;GeoRestriction&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;RestrictionType&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;none&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>احفظ معرّف التوزيع (<code>E1A2B3C4D5E6F7</code>) واسم النطاق (<code>d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net</code>).</p>\n<p>انتظر نشر التوزيع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">wait</span> distribution-deployed \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --region us-east-1\n</code></pre>\n<p>يحجب هذا الأمر التنفيذ حتى تتغير الحالة من <code>InProgress</code> إلى <code>Deployed</code>. وعدم وجود ناتج يعني النجاح.</p>\n<h2 id=\"تحديث-سياسة-حاوية-s3\">تحديث سياسة حاوية S3</h2>\n<p>احفظ ما يلي باسم <code>bucket-policy-oac.json</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Version&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;2012-10-17&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Statement&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Sid&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;AllowCloudFrontServicePrincipal&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Effect&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Allow&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Principal&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Service&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cloudfront.amazonaws.com&quot;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Action&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;s3:GetObject&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Resource&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;arn:aws:s3:::my-frontend-app-assets/*&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Condition&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;StringEquals&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;AWS:SourceArn&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;arn:aws:cloudfront::123456789012:distribution/E1A2B3C4D5E6F7&quot;</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>طبّق السياسة:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws s3api put-bucket-policy \\\n  --bucket my-frontend-app-assets \\\n  --policy file://bucket-policy-oac.json \\\n  --region us-east-1\n</code></pre>\n<p>لا ناتج عند النجاح.</p>\n<p>تحقّق من السياسة:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws s3api get-bucket-policy \\\n  --bucket my-frontend-app-assets \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json\n</code></pre>\n<p>اختبر الوصول عبر CloudFront:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -I https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>HTTP/2 200\ncontent-type: text/html\n</code></pre>\n<p>اختبر أن الوصول المباشر إلى S3 محظور:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -I https://my-frontend-app-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>HTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"إعادة-تمكين-حظر-الوصول-العام\">إعادة تمكين حظر الوصول العام</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws s3api put-public-access-block \\\n  --bucket my-frontend-app-assets \\\n  --public-access-block-configuration \\\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;BlockPublicAcls=true,IgnorePublicAcls=true,BlockPublicPolicy=true,RestrictPublicBuckets=true&quot;</span> \\\n  --region us-east-1\n</code></pre>\n<p>لا ناتج عند النجاح.</p>\n<p>تحقّق من تمكين حظر الوصول العام:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws s3api get-public-access-block \\\n  --bucket my-frontend-app-assets \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;PublicAccessBlockConfiguration&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;BlockPublicAcls&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;IgnorePublicAcls&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;BlockPublicPolicy&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;RestrictPublicBuckets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>تحقّق من أن CloudFront ما زال يعمل:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -I https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>ما زال <code>200 OK</code>. فسياسة الخدمة الأساسية لـ CloudFront لا تُعد سياسة «عامة».</p>\n<h2 id=\"اختبار-توجيه-spa\">اختبار توجيه SPA</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -I https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net/dashboard/settings\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code>HTTP/2 200\ncontent-type: text/html\n</code></pre>\n<p>تعترض استجابة الخطأ المخصّصة رمز 403 القادم من S3 (لأن <code>/dashboard/settings</code> غير موجود ككائن) وتعيد <code>/index.html</code> برمز حالة 200. أما موجّهك في جهة العميل فيتولى الباقي.</p>\n<p>اختبر مسارًا آخر غير موجود:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -I https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net/users/123/profile\n</code></pre>\n<p>النتيجة نفسها: <code>200 OK</code> مع <code>text/html</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"إرفاق-سياسة-ترويسات-الأمان\">إرفاق سياسة ترويسات الأمان</h2>\n<p>اجلب تهيئة التوزيع الحالية:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront get-distribution-config \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json &gt; distribution-config-current.json\n</code></pre>\n<p>دوّن <code>ETag</code> في الاستجابة (مثل <code>E3ETAG3EXAMPLE</code>).</p>\n<p>عدّل <code>DistributionConfig</code> لتضيف <code>ResponseHeadersPolicyId</code> إلى <code>DefaultCacheBehavior</code>. وينبغي أن يبدو السلوك المحدّث هكذا:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;DefaultCacheBehavior&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;TargetOriginId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;S3-my-frontend-app-assets&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ViewerProtocolPolicy&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;redirect-to-https&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CachePolicyId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;658327ea-f89d-4fab-a63d-7e88639e58f6&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;ResponseHeadersPolicyId&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;67f7725c-6f97-4210-82d7-5512b31e9d03&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Compress&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">true</span></span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;AllowedMethods&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;GET&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;HEAD&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;CachedMethods&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Quantity&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Items&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;GET&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;HEAD&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>استخرج <code>DistributionConfig</code> (دون غلاف <code>ETag</code>) إلى <code>distribution-config-updated.json</code> وأرسله:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront update-distribution \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --if-match E3ETAG3EXAMPLE \\\n  --distribution-config file://distribution-config-updated.json \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json\n</code></pre>\n<p>انتظر النشر:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">wait</span> distribution-deployed \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --region us-east-1\n</code></pre>\n<p>تحقّق من ترويسات الأمان:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -I https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع (من بين ترويسات أخرى):</p>\n<pre><code>strict-transport-security: max-age=31536000\nx-content-type-options: nosniff\nx-frame-options: SAMEORIGIN\nx-xss-protection: 1; mode=block\nreferrer-policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"التحقق-النهائي\">التحقق النهائي</h2>\n<p>شغّل كل الفحوصات:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Distribution status</span>\naws cloudfront get-distribution \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --region us-east-1 \\\n  --output json \\\n  --query <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Distribution.{Id:Id,Domain:DomainName,Status:Status}&quot;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>المتوقع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Id&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;E1A2B3C4D5E6F7&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Domain&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;Status&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Deployed&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\"># HTTPS works</span>\ncurl -I https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># SPA routing works</span>\ncurl -I https://d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net/any/spa/route\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># S3 is locked down</span>\ncurl -I https://my-frontend-app-assets.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/index.html\n</code></pre>\n<p>النتائج المتوقعة: تعيد CloudFront الرمز <code>200 OK</code> لكل من الجذر ومسار SPA. أما الوصول المباشر إلى S3 فيعيد <code>403 Forbidden</code>.</p>\n<p>افتح نطاق CloudFront في متصفح لترى الموقع مباشرًا:</p>\n<p><img src=\"/arabic-cs-library/images/kinney/e6808f0fa9cac56d.webp\" alt=\"الموقع الثابت المقدّم عبر CloudFront بـ HTTPS، ويعرض «Hello from S3» على خلفية داكنة مع طابع زمني لتحميل الصفحة.\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"ملخص-الموارد-المنشأة\">ملخص الموارد المنشأة</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>المورد</th>\n<th>المعرّف</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Origin Access Control</td>\n<td><code>E1OAC2EXAMPLE</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>توزيع CloudFront</td>\n<td><code>E1A2B3C4D5E6F7</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>نطاق التوزيع</td>\n<td><code>d1234abcdef.cloudfront.net</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>سياسة حاوية S3</td>\n<td>محدّثة لتسمح لـ CloudFront فقط</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>سياسة ترويسات الاستجابة</td>\n<td><code>67f7725c-6f97-4210-82d7-5512b31e9d03</code> (SecurityHeadersPolicy مُدارة)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>سياسة الذاكرة المؤقتة</td>\n<td><code>658327ea-f89d-4fab-a63d-7e88639e58f6</code> (CachingOptimized مُدارة)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>توزيعك الآن مباشر ومؤمّن على نطاقه <code>*.cloudfront.net</code>. وإن أردت إرفاق نطاق مخصّص لاحقًا، فراجع قسم <a href=\"https://stevekinney.com/courses/aws/dns-for-frontend-engineers\">النطاقات المخصّصة وDNS والشهادات</a> الاختياري في نهاية الدورة.</p>\n<h2 id=\"التنظيف\">التنظيف</h2>\n<p>عندما تنتهي من هذا التمرين، فكّك الموارد لتجنّب الرسوم المستمرة. يجب أن يكون التوزيع <em>معطّلًا</em> قبل أن تسمح لك CloudFront بحذفه—والتعطيل هو الجزء البطيء (15–30 دقيقة). أما الحذف الفعلي فسريع بمجرد أن تبلغ الحالة <code>Deployed</code>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>قبل أن تنسخ هذه الأوامر</strong></p>\n<p>المعرّفات أدناه (<code>E1A2B3C4D5E6F7</code> للتوزيع، و<code>E1OAC2EXAMPLE</code> لـ OAC) هي عناصر نائبة—استبدلها بمعرّفاتك الفعلية. اعثر على معرّفاتك بالأمر <code>aws cloudfront list-distributions --query 'DistributionList.Items[].{Id:Id,Domain:DomainName}' --output table</code> و<code>aws cloudfront list-origin-access-controls --output table</code>.</p>\n<p>شغّل هذه الأوامر في جلسة shell واحدة كي تبقى <code>$ETAG</code> و<code>$NEW_ETAG</code> و<code>$OAC_ETAG</code> في النطاق. فإن عدت في طرفية جديدة، فأعد جلب كل ETag قبل تشغيل الأمر الذي يستخدمه.</p>\n<p>تحقّق مرة أخرى من أن <code>&quot;Enabled&quot;: false</code> في <code>distribution-config.json</code> قبل إرسال التحديث. فتركها <code>true</code> هو أكثر طريقة شائعة لفشل هذا التنظيف—إذ يرفض <code>delete-distribution</code> توزيعًا ممكّنًا بخطأ <code>DistributionNotDisabled</code>، ويبدو استدعاء <code>wait distribution-deployed</code> التالي عالقًا.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>اجلب التهيئة الحالية وETag:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">ETAG=$(aws cloudfront get-distribution-config \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --query <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ETag&#x27;</span> --output text)\n\naws cloudfront get-distribution-config \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --query <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;DistributionConfig&#x27;</span> \\\n  --output json &gt; distribution-config.json\n</code></pre>\n<p>عدّل <code>distribution-config.json</code> واضبط <code>&quot;Enabled&quot;: false</code>، ثم أرسل التحديث:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront update-distribution \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --distribution-config file://distribution-config.json \\\n  --if-match <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$ETAG</span>&quot;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>انتظر <code>Status: Deployed</code> (هذه هي الخطوة البطيئة—اصنع فنجان قهوة):</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws cloudfront <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">wait</span> distribution-deployed --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7\n</code></pre>\n<p>اجلب ETag الجديد (فهو يتغير مع كل تحديث)، ثم احذف:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">NEW_ETAG=$(aws cloudfront get-distribution-config \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --query <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ETag&#x27;</span> --output text)\n\naws cloudfront delete-distribution \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1A2B3C4D5E6F7 \\\n  --if-match <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$NEW_ETAG</span>&quot;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>احذف OAC:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">OAC_ETAG=$(aws cloudfront get-origin-access-control \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1OAC2EXAMPLE \\\n  --query <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ETag&#x27;</span> --output text)\n\naws cloudfront delete-origin-access-control \\\n  --<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span> E1OAC2EXAMPLE \\\n  --if-match <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$OAC_ETAG</span>&quot;</span>\n</code></pre>\n"}